WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.875
Signal now blocks the AI

00:00:01.675 --> 00:00:03.941
assistants inside your phone from

00:00:03.741 --> 00:00:05.295
reading your chats,

00:00:05.095 --> 00:00:06.933
and admits the fix has holes.

00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:09.531
The tool is screenshot blocking.

00:00:09.571 --> 00:00:12.431
Signal president Meredith Whittaker announced

00:00:12.231 --> 00:00:13.988
it on November twentieth,

00:00:13.788 --> 00:00:15.285
and calls it incomplete.

00:00:15.835 --> 00:00:18.207
Encryption still protects messages on

00:00:18.007 --> 00:00:18.865
the network.

00:00:18.905 --> 00:00:20.476
But on screen they are

00:00:20.276 --> 00:00:22.151
just pixels, and Siri AI

00:00:21.951 --> 00:00:23.825
and Gemini read the screen.

00:00:24.375 --> 00:00:26.217
On iPhone, Block Siri AI

00:00:26.017 --> 00:00:28.977
stops screenshots, and reportedly ships

00:00:28.777 --> 00:00:29.723
switched on.

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:31.842
On Android, Signal reacts when

00:00:31.642 --> 00:00:33.050
it spots an assistant.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:33.899
On a Mac,

00:00:33.699 --> 00:00:34.751
it can do nothing.

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:36.932
Update Signal everywhere.

00:00:36.972 --> 00:00:38.448
On iPhone and Mac,

00:00:38.248 --> 00:00:40.175
add Signal to Excluded Apps

00:00:39.975 --> 00:00:41.452
in the Siri settings.

00:00:41.492 --> 00:00:43.396
On Android, switch on Screen

00:00:43.196 --> 00:00:44.445
security yourself.

00:00:44.995 --> 00:00:46.910
Signal names the holes itself.

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.866
Saved files stay exposed,

00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:50.297
and so do Android phones

00:00:50.097 --> 00:00:52.085
where it misses the assistant.

00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:54.506
Agents with accessibility access can

00:00:54.306 --> 00:00:55.733
still read the screen.

00:00:56.283 --> 00:00:58.793
Whittaker calls it an existential threat.

00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:00.271
She asks Apple,

00:01:00.071 --> 00:01:02.169
Google and Microsoft for a

00:01:01.969 --> 00:01:03.985
documented way for any app

00:01:03.785 --> 00:01:05.471
to opt out of AI access.

00:01:06.021 --> 00:01:07.490
The fight over the pipe

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:09.227
between phones was largely won.

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:11.280
Built-in assistants reopen it on

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.958
the device, where apps have

00:01:12.758 --> 00:01:13.697
almost no say.

00:01:14.247 --> 00:01:16.235
Every setting and every gap,

00:01:16.035 --> 00:01:17.679
platform by platform,

00:01:17.479 --> 00:01:18.779
is in the full story

00:01:18.579 --> 00:01:19.673
on The Dispatch.

